flowchart TB
    A[Refund Request] --> B[Pin Policy]
    B --> C[Check Delivery/Return Evidence]
    C --> D[Check Payment State]
    D --> E[Check Fraud/Risk]
    E --> F{High Risk or High Value?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Requires Review]
    F -- No --> H{Evidence Complete?}
    H -- Yes --> I[Approve + refundDecisionId]
    H -- No --> J[Defer or Refuse]
    G --> R[Replay Card]
    I --> R
    J --> R
